EXCEPTION — OpenStreetMap-derived geometry
------------------------------------------
datasets/track_geometry/track_geometry_osm_derived.csv is derived from
OpenStreetMap data and is licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL)
1.0, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors — https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

ODbL carries a share-alike obligation that ODC-BY does not. That file is kept
separate so that combining it with the rest is your explicit decision; if you
merge them, treat the result as ODbL.

datasets/track_weather additionally requires attribution to Open-Meteo, the
source of the historical weather series.

